": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1327505932765311_5286460740341237931_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FJWEUR1n1MkQ7kNvwFA-V6J&_nc_oc=AdpHTOMVTnILwjS58G1VHzcRDLejzo-qvmGdKvyOyUbZtl5dw52uV7w-t64YvptdlT0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBbL-gCutx_OD4OV_0heFRBBIgepuwL0IzS0YM1m_SHmg&oe=6A6DE364"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (33).png", "id": "2076724189787348", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_2076724193120681_4871879008737988130_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SaOL3JXbNx8Q7kNvwEIqLiu&_nc_oc=AdrImHDCyqbM91gdAVuQ_skUGc0nnRH1ZfFkljtVaqA036o59DuA2eqN2I90eAdtbCY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBSdWRewIDVN8IlrIwm_QnIdhg_MPikNgt_jRyUON8oOg&oe=6A6DF6D7"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00033.png", "id": "3932380693732122", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_3932380697065455_5087597325838508038_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0R6teo0SOQUQ7kNvwEtSd0Z&_nc_oc=AdpzDAJzQQ1ONngNiBClO6D74JJlGkvJrFoP5HSS_FfV2uSCr6yZemoShSeLxl8Y6mU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAbAktDpaIVdrfpah4LpBhFV9KEXS2BfNGiI615m8E91Q&oe=6A6DD5A2"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (34).png", "id": "890620570035576", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_890620573368909_3665044860292886222_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o5e9_tW9ibcQ7kNvwE_vRq0&_nc_oc=AdrfYSRTESzlNj0bJRRkyOV3vsUIneIeSlK3TwHgS_x2U0jtUQ18nBQd50xwaUx2hrs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDTTM5-rm_WWDBptl-lQZrgX1qe9kJp6sdIbfVeuruUMw&oe=6A6E08DB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Zbonk_LakeHouse_2560x1440.png", "id": "1547163436915760", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825305_1547163440249093_3018434286459742065_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IA2t2GCyZ44Q7kNvwGBmfzR&_nc_oc=AdrNUXOjGe6iI00wnGU_dQex5iKK9Wco-HoCyCOhXx05y4dA2MfXB9flHqP1cv-w8Og&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBDLh1wDikWkJfa_mLsgiLHcMGLn73nN_PhgKLRmPvzqQ&oe=6A6DEC79"}, "display_name": "ZOMBONK", "keywords": ["zombie", "gun", "shooting", "multiplayer", "monke"], "long_description": "# Bonker wake up. World gone. Whatever.\n\nZombies and monsters everywhere. Bonker still vibing. \ud83d\ude0e\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\n\nExplore maps, crack open boxes, hunt for gear, survive long enough to flex it.\n\nLoot stuff \u2192 Sell stuff \u2192 Get Bonk$ \u2192 Buy drip. \n\n# Multiple maps to choose from:\n- \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Bonktopia City - open, quiet, and NOT SAFE\n- \ud83e\udddf Zombie Survival - relentless waves, COD zombies vibes\n- \ud83c\udfeb School - three levels. too many footsteps.\n- \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Space - out it the orbit, something broke into the station\n- \ud83d\udca3 War - they started it, you end it\n- \ud83d\udc1bNest - what lies underground will shock you\n- \ud83c\udffaTemple - explore the secrets of the civilizations before bonkers\n- \ud83c\udfaa Bonkland - horror carnival with dark rooms, laser pathways, & targets everywhere.\n- \ud83c\udd99 Skybonk - an Only Up inspired parkour map, with zombies of course\n\nPro Tip: Bonk with friends for more loot and more BONK$. \n\nPlay in private servers or chill in the Social Hub safe zone to hang with fellow Bonkers.\n\n**\ud83e\udd1d Come hang in discord, and meet our bonker community \ud83d\udc49 discord.gg/zbvr**\n", "short_description": "Survive the zombie apocalypse, loot for guns and items!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Sinn Studio Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_r